    "run_termination_model.v1 retained_population/finalize, workflow_projection_model.v3 project_admitted_run_v3, identity-model.v3 cache-key admission and EvidenceStore.prepare: propagate close_run exceptions with no name matching.",
    "identity-model.v3 EvidenceStore.restore: typed CompleteReplayMismatch -> RegenerationMismatch (intentional v2 change).",
    "query_projection_model.v3 close_retained_run: typed routing (v2).",
    "identity-model.py (v2 historical) close_run: separate module/classes; unaffected."
