   "severity": "limitation / root integration",
   "title": "Pin-gated security owner suite cannot provide post-correction case evidence until rebind",
   "evidence": "check-security-lifecycle.v1 on the integrated copy exits 1 at its source-pin gate: sourcePinsValid false, changedOrMissing exactly the two corrected files; no cases ran. That is neither a pass nor a regression. A scan of all 22 security JSON documents finds no case with model analysis-seal, and revocation-live-cases states complete analysis-SEAL cases live in check-analysis-seal-adapter.v1.py, so the blocked suite does not exercise the changed except clause. Root final38 security group passed on the before bytes."
